{
  "description": "An immobile, Invisible, Cube-shaped prison composed of magical force springs into existence around an area within range. The prison can be a cage or a solid box. Creatures completely inside are trapped; partial creatures or those too large are pushed away. A creature inside can't leave by nonmagical means. Teleportation or interplanar travel requires a Charisma saving throw first; on a failed save, the creature doesn't exit and wastes the spell or effect. The cage extends into the Ethereal Plane and can't be dispelled by Dispel Magic.",
